# [Goal Description]
**Target**: Build the **GSD AI Training Academy**—an "On-Demand Factory" that generates courses for Orchestrators.
**Core Concept**: A rigid, error-free **Structural Shell** that creates a unique course by plugging in specific "Knowledge Cartridges" (from NotebookLM) and "Instrument Sets" (AI Agents).

